# Camp X / Special Training School 103 — conceptual wartime study, not a site plan
WorldInfo { title "Camp X — STS 103 and Hydra" }
DEF FIELD Material { diffuseColor 0.45 0.53 0.31 }
DEF SOIL Material { diffuseColor 0.36 0.31 0.23 }
DEF LAKE Material { diffuseColor 0.20 0.43 0.59 transparency 0.12 specularColor 0.30 0.55 0.65 }
